- MT51     : (n,n') angular distribution and photon production    7325 1451
             for first excited state                              7325 1451
                                                                  7325 1451
The angular distribution for inelastic scattering to the first    7325 1451
inelastic state is given with Legendre coefficients up to 20 MeV. 7325 1451
Next, the exclusive yields for all the discrete gamma rays that   7325 1451
originate from this particular level are given.                   7325 1451
                                                                  7325 1451
